  message: "TRUE DUPLICATE of WI-muzus (folded). Same field (limits.analysis_depth), same defect (dead 'syntax_only' constant misdescribing the semantic analysis performed, undocumented). Both independent reproduction scouts confirmed the duplication (WI-muzus is the older/canonical, created 2026-06-06 with 3 dogfood re-confirmations; WI-zusok created 2026-06-08). Resolved by the WI-muzus REMOVE (PR 9f5f24251b) — the field is gone, so this item's defect no longer exists. No separate work. (WI-zusok also noted a reproducibility_context.level='L2' cross-reference disagreement; moot now that analysis_depth is removed — the only remaining static depth descriptor is reproducibility_context.level, which is a distinct reproducibility axis.)"  # 7c06
